  "system": {
    "identifier": "hyuga-8-trigrams-64-palms",
    "description": "<p>You perform the signature technique of the Gentle fist. Make a single melee Taijutsu attack, vs the AC the result against all creatures of your choice AC, within your unarmed attack range. On a hit, you deal your [Unarmed Damage] + 3d8 Chakra damage. Half of the chakra damage dealt is also dealt as force damage to the target.</p>\n<p>Eight Trigram. You can choose to force the affected creature(s) to make a Constitution saving throw, suffering either Disrupt II or Block II on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Disrupt II: They gain 2 ranks of Network Distortion.</p>\n<p>Block II: They gain 2 rank of Weakened.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d8. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, you make one additional attack and creatures you strike with both attacks suffer Disrupt III or Block III. You cannot make additional attacks beyond the listed amount for this jutsu.</p>\n<p>Disrupt III: They gain 3 ranks of Network Distortion.</p>\n<p>Block III: They gain 3 rank of Weakened.</p>",
